# Local-only, non-distributed reference oracles (non-commercial license — never
# vendored, never CI, dev-machine benchmarking only). ILUPACK V2.4 precompiled lib
# (non-commercial/academic use only per ilupack.tu-bs.de/copyright.shtml) lives here
# behind the CRD_BUILD_HESAP_VS_ILUPACK dev flag. See docs/phases/phase-3.1.6-hesap.md.
external/

