# scene-render gates now write their per-run packs to the OS TEMP dir (TempPack RAII, REN-38 hygiene pass);
# this pattern stays as a belt-and-braces guard for older checkouts and crashed runs.
sr_*.crdr
ev_stream_*.crdr
.crd_*/
imgui.ini
crashes/
out/
.tmp-*.log
__pycache__/
CLAUDE.md

# Research PAPERS are reference material, not source. They are large (GitHub hard-rejects any blob >100 MB, and a
# 218 MB PDF once made the whole repo unpushable), they never diff usefully, and they live permanently in history
# after a single commit. Keep them OUT of git and store them alongside the repo instead; docs/research/*.md cites
# them by title so the knowledge stays version-controlled while the bytes do not.
docs/research/papers/
*.pdf
